{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44684","headline":"三不爲篇 一 · 海顺","name":"三不爲篇 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我欲偃文修武，身死名存。\n斫石通道，祈井流泉。\n君肝在内，我身处边。\n荆轲拔剑，毛遂捧盘。\n不爲则已，爲则不然。\n将恐两虎共鬬，势不俱全。\n永□今好，长绝来怨。\n是以返迹荒径，息影柴门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"海顺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44684.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44684","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}